  "slug": "kraz",
  "name": "KRAZ",
  "shortName": null,
  "description": "KRAZ is an annual furry convention in Boskovice, Czech Republic, whose name is short for \"Kreslící sraz\", Czech for \"drawing meeting\". It focuses on furry art such as drawing, painting, sculpting and photography, alongside games, contests, dances and fursuit events. The organizer is KRAZ z.s., which also runs Furrstein, Fursuit Halloween Prague, Halloween Outing and MiniCon. After starting in 2013 and spending its early years at a hostel in Hlavatce, it has been held since 2019 at Western City Boskovice, a park modeled on an 1800s American frontier town, where attendees can stay in an on-site hotel, log cabins or a tent area.",
